sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor HoD as Head of Department
    participant UI as ConsoleApp
    participant MS as ModerationService
    participant SR as ISubmissionRepository
    participant TX as ITransactionRunner
    participant AO as AuditObserver
    participant AR as IAuditRepository
    participant SO as StatusObserver
    HoD->>UI: 2 Approve a mark (submission id)
    UI->>MS: approve(hod, submissionId)
    MS->>SR: findById(submissionId)
    SR-->>MS: Submission (state MARKED)
    MS->>MS: check HoD role and department, then transitionTo(MODERATED)
    MS->>TX: runInTransaction
    activate TX
    TX->>SR: saveModeratedMark(id, rawMark, hodId)
    TX->>AO: onMarkChanged(entry: who, when, old, new, reason)
    AO->>AR: append(entry)
    TX->>SO: onStateChanged(id, MARKED, MODERATED)
    SO->>SR: setState(id, MODERATED)
    deactivate TX
    Note over TX: any failure rolls back the mark, the audit entry and the state together
    MS-->>UI: done
    HoD->>UI: 6 Release marks (assignment id)
    UI->>MS: release(hod, assignmentId)
    MS->>SR: findByAssignment(assignmentId)
    alt some submissions not moderated
        MS-->>UI: RuleViolation lists pending submissions
        UI->>HoD: Release only the moderated marks? (y/n)
    else all moderated, or HoD answers y
        MS->>TX: runInTransaction
        TX->>SR: setReleasedAt(id, now) for each moderated submission
        TX->>SO: onStateChanged(id, MODERATED, RELEASED)
        MS-->>UI: number of marks released
    end
